    "table 'Sessions': 1 note(s) with no time; left out",
    "table 'Subjects': 1 BiologicalSex value(s) not among female, male, not detected; kept as written",
    "table 'Sessions (curated)': 1 row(s) not found in the session table; left out of its view",
    "session method code/+RatNav/+sessionmethod/+process/+tools/makeLabel.m: makeLabel.m does not call nansen.session.SessionMethod.setAttributes, so it is not a dev session method; left out",
    "pipeline 'Two-photon preprocessing': task 'Plot stats' (nansen.module.ophys.twophoton.sessionmethod.plot.plotImageStats) has no method here; left out",
    "pipeline 'Plots only': task 'Plot stats' (nansen.module.ophys.twophoton.sessionmethod.plot.plotImageStats) has no method here; left out",
    "pipeline 'Plots only': task 'Plot speed' used dev's option preset 'Fast', which is not carried over; the method's defaults are used",
    "option presets of nansen.wrapper.normcorre.Processor (fast, thorough) are not carried over: dev's options are not the methods' here"
